1
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,600
General Ning is here.

2
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,090
What did you call me?

3
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:57,600
General Ning.

4
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,640
General Ning has always

5
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,320
looked down on

6
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,760
these entertainment houses.

7
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:04,290
What brings you here today?

8
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,900
I suspect the person who fought Cui Hu

9
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:10,840
at the Qixi Lantern Festival

10
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:13,080
is an enemy spy
from the Northern Frontier.

11
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:15,539
This person is currently
hiding in the city.

12
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:16,760
You are the manager here.

13
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,690
You should know.

14
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,020
Make sure no thieves sneak in.

15
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:21,920
Otherwise,

16
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,160
you can't bear

17
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,260
the crime of harboring spies.

18
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:32,240
I appreciate your kind reminder, General.

19
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,280
General Ning,

20
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,600
Mr. Chu

21
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,400
is very responsible.

22
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:40,160
He is in charge of the renovation of

23
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,280
the whole theater.

24
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,759
He truly deserves to be called

25
00:01:42,759 --> 00:01:44,520
the greatest talent in the capital.

26
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:45,560
Hanging his painting

27
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,280
up makes

28
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,000
the whole place shine,

29
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:48,940
doesn't it?

30
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,280
Rule number one of

31
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,810
advancing a relationship:

32
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:56,400
the best way to make
a man realize his feelings

33
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,960
is to make him jealous first.

34
00:01:57,960 --> 00:02:00,090
Ning Yuanci is extremely possessive.

35
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,280
He likes women who take the initiative,

36
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,560
but not too much.

37
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:05,160
Watch how I play hard to get with him.

38
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,080
General Ning,

39
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,600
my father said your marriage to my sister

40
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,520
is a done deal.

41
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,370
Even with your high status,

42
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,290
there's nothing you can do.

43
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,600
So Ying'er won't blame you.

44
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,840
After you marry my sister,

45
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,450
we can still be friends.

46
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,640
You must come visit

47
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:23,100
our theater in the future.

48
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,640
Mr. Chu and I

49
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,600
will definitely treat you well.

50
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:27,680
I, Ning Yuanci,

51
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,370
never make friends with women.

52
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,800
I think you just don't
have any friends at all.

53
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:43,760
At the engagement party,

54
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,290
you only had Cui Hu with you.

55
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:46,920
Five years ago

56
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:48,800
General Ning's father, Marquis Zhongjing,

57
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,730
was ambushed by the Northern Army.

58
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,200
His brothers and parents

59
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,240
all sacrificed their lives in that battle.

60
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,120
Now,

61
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:58,280
he is indeed the only one
left in the Ning family.

62
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,280
That's so tragic.

63
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,760
The Duke and Marquis Zhongjing

64
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,480
had been best friends since their youth.

65
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,210
Lady Keying,

66
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,450
I can't believe you didn't know...

67
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,680
Xue Shiyan thinks

68
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,000
Xue Ruowan's marriage to me
is a foregone conclusion.

69
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,400
But this matter is not for him to decide.

70
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,120
Deliver the marriage document I prepared

71
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,520
to the Duke's Residence.

72
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:23,440
Xue Keying and I are deeply in love.

73
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:26,440
Today I will petition His Majesty

74
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,220
for a new marriage decree.

75
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:33,320
Ning Yuanci is going to marry Ying'er.

76
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:35,520
My Ying'er has finally gotten her wish.

77
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:36,160
Look.

78
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,680
This is wonderful news.

79
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,480
I do not agree.

80
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,800
How can Ning Yuanci

81
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,800
just pick and choose

82
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,520
which of my daughters to marry?

83
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,000
You...

84
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,840
How does this handwriting look?

85
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,420
Last time, Keying said

86
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,280
she wanted to change the theater's plaque.

87
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,400
She asked me to write it

88
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,460
and have it framed.

89
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,440
My Lady,

90
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,240
for so many years in the mansion,

91
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,120
the Second Young Lady has bullied

92
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,360
and made things difficult for you.

93
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,480
She snatches away

94
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:09,680
everything you like.

95
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,520
Yet you still help her like this.

96
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:12,520
Xiaolan,

97
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:15,140
people can't always live in the past,

98
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,560
let alone live in hatred.

99
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,480
Although Keying is unruly,

100
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,130
she is not bad by nature.

101
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:22,560
Besides, even if someone makes a mistake,

102
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,280
everyone deserves

103
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,610
a chance to be forgiven.

104
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,160
If Xiaolan makes a mistake,

105
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,760
will you forgive me, My Lady?

106
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:28,560
Of course.

107
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,480
We grew up together

108
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,680
like sisters.

109
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,720
I have

110
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,120
something to tell you.

111
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:36,920
I,

112
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:38,620
Xue Ruowan,

113
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,280
Ning Yuanci is preparing
to request an imperial decree.

114
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,000
Have His Majesty revoke

115
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,080
your marriage contract with him.

116
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:43,640
Really?

117
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,850
Yes, really.

118
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,520
Truly.

119
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,760
But will Father agree?

120
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:51,400
Father is most afraid of offending people.

121
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,280
Ning Yuanci is the Defender General.

122
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,880
He is also His Majesty's adopted son.

123
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,680
How could Father go against him?

124
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,020
It is so hot.

125
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,520
I came to tell you this good news

126
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,840
the moment I heard it.

127
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:08,880
Your scar

128
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:11,000
seems to have faded a bit.

129
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,280
It seems so.

130
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:19,000
Maybe it's because I've been
in a good mood lately,

131
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,760
so my skin got firmer.

132
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,000
By the way,

133
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,680
I've finished the calligraphy

134
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,010
you asked for last time.

135
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:29,500
What beautiful handwriting.

136
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,920
Once your engagement is broken off,

137
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,930
you'll be completely free.

138
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,240
Then you can focus on your career

139
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,400
with Mr. Chu.

140
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,440
An ambitious princess,

141
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,600
to achieve military merits,

142
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,320
Disguising her identity

143
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,680
to approach the innocent and kind

144
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,540
tribal prince,

145
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,960
the two fell in love amidst a deception.

146
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,600
The princess's scheme

147
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,480
led to the annihilation
of the prince's entire tribe.

148
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:51,200
Agonized by his love for the princess,

149
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,680
he decided to jump
into the River of Amnesia.

150
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,760
Filled with endless regret,

151
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,760
the princess

152
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:57,920
jumped down with him.

153
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,920
After waking up...

154
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,380
They lost their memories,

155
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,600
met again,

156
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,080
and fell back in love,

157
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:03,920
starting

158
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,200
a bittersweet romance of reuniting.

159
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,200
What do you think?

160
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,600
It's okay.

161
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,400
It's fine if you don't understand.

162
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,520
Anyway, you play the princess,

163
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,250
and you play the tribal prince.

164
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,680
I can't act in this play.

165
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,720
Since a princess can achieve
military merits,

166
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,720
why not

167
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,720
just stage

168
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:25,040
Mulan taking her father's place
in the army?

169
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,560
Classic plays are good,

170
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,560
but without

171
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,760
a dramatic romance,

172
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,600
the audience won't buy it.

173
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,740
Let's perform this

174
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,000
for our opening premiere.

175
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,080
After Amnesia.

176
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,960
And falling in love with the enemy,

177
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:37,560
the prince.

178
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,090
Isn't that a bit too tragic?

179
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,360
Can't you see

180
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,330
I am helping you?

181
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,400
There is no

182
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,880
better opportunity than falling in love

183
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:46,840
through acting.

184
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,400
Keying,

185
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:50,280
are you hiding something

186
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:50,840
from me?

187
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,440
Well...

188
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:56,880
I plan to leave the theater
after the premiere.

189
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:58,680
I plan to leave the theater
after the premiere.

190
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,400
You two

191
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,600
manage it well together.

192
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,280
Leave?

193
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,480
Why is that?

194
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,200
Because

195
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,120
I am going to marry Ning Yuanci.

196
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,640
What?

197
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,740
You are marrying Ning Yuanci?

198
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,040
Yes.

199
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:12,120
Why else do you think

200
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,440
he suddenly

201
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,880
broke off the engagement?

202
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:15,960
But you know full well

203
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,080
his marriage alliance with the Xue family

204
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,080
is only for power.

205
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:18,970
You also said

206
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,300
you no longer like him.

207
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,890
Why still marry him?

208
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,220
Life is like a play.

209
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:25,760
If he can deceive,

210
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,680
so can I.

211
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,200
Besides,

212
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:28,960
one of us

213
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,200
has to marry him.

214
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,560
As for you,

215
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,240
go live the life you want

216
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:35,240
and love the one you want to love.

217
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,560
As for Ning Yuanci,

218
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,280
leave him to me to deal with.

219
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:42,700
You were the one

220
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,480
who proposed building this theater.

221
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,760
Now you are going back on your word
and leaving.

222
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:47,620
Then I quit too.

223
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:51,080
I am doing this all for your own good.

224
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,480
I never asked you

225
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,610
to do all this for me.

226
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:54,800
Besides,

227
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:56,280
when you did it,

228
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,760
did you ever ask

229
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,130
if I actually needed it?

230
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,280
I...

231
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,200
Ladies,

232
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,360
please don't argue
over such a small thing.

233
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:03,920
Don't be mad.

234
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,180
None of your business.

235
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,130
Are you still angry?

236
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,620
Please accept my apology.

237
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,960
I take back what I said
about leaving the troupe.

238
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,320
I just wanted

239
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,880
to give you and Young Master Chu

240
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:36,960
more chances

241
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,620
to be alone.

242
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,159
Young Master Chu and I

243
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,289
are merely friends.

244
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,679
Why must you

245
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:43,820
insist on playing matchmaker for us?

246
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,560
I agreed

247
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,280
to run Moxiang Theater with you

248
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,480
because you said that

249
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,280
even as women of the inner courtyard,

250
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:54,000
we have the right

251
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,160
to pursue freedom

252
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:56,280
and dreams.

253
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,120
Besides,

254
00:08:58,760 --> 00:08:59,880
I don't want you

255
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,880
to accept a loveless marriage

256
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:01,840
for my sake.

257
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,160
Okay, okay,

258
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:06,920
I know you're a strong independent woman.

259
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:07,560
You have no room

260
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,960
for romance in your head.

261
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,760
Although I agreed to the engagement

262
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,200
mainly to help you,

263
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,320
Ning Yuanci and I

264
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:19,380
aren't completely devoid of true feelings.

265
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:21,560
It wouldn't hurt to have

266
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,000
a little romance.

267
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,880
Ning Yuanci did ask the Emperor

268
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,280
for a new marriage edict,

269
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,480
but Father went to
the Privy Council early this morning

270
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,160
to submit a memorial.

271
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,690
He claimed General Ning abandoned you

272
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:34,440
and tried to ruin

273
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,960
the reputation of us sisters,

274
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,040
asking the Emperor

275
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:39,000
to uphold the original engagement.

276
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:39,760
What?

277
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,650
Why is Father ruining my plans too?

278
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,920
It just shows how much
Father truly cares for you.

279
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,280
He can't bear to see you
enter the General's Manor,

280
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,280
that lion's den.

281
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,160
But Ning Yuanci...

282
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,280
It's not that scary, is it?

283
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,840
Rumor has it that

284
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,280
General Ning is ruthless

285
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,260
and debauched.

286
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:03,000
He often tortures and kills

287
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,200
the maids in his mansion,

288
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,660
and to women, he is even...

289
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:08,020
Rumors stop with the wise.

290
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,080
Not even a female mosquito

291
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,120
can get into

292
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:11,920
his backyard.

293
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,040
Even if Father stands in my way,

294
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:15,770
I have a plan.

295
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,680
What plan?

296
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,320
The trick of a substitute bride
may be cliché,

297
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,450
but it always works.

298
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,520
The world calls her a phoenix
on the branch,

299
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,320
a woman favored by fate.

300
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:29,520
No one knows she is
but a sparrow in the palm,

301
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,420
at the mercy of fate at every turn.

302
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,760
If the phoenix does not rise
from the ashes...

303
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:35,800
can only be reduced

304
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,680
to a plaything for others to admire.

305
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,040
Though the sparrow is small,

306
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:41,760
it has the courage
to break free from its shackles.

307
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:42,680
You are me,

308
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,520
and I am you.

309
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,170
General,

310
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,490
what play are they performing?

311
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,490
I have never seen it before.

312
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,760
Either a sparrow becomes a phoenix,

313
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,800
or a phoenix becomes a sparrow.

314
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,400
General Ning has a sharp eye.

315
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:05,640
Guess who is the older sister

316
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:06,320
and who is the younger.
